  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MHPSS Technical Working Group Coordinator with World Health Organization (WHO) in DR Congo (MHPSS23009)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The provinces of North Kivu, South Kivu, Ituri and Tschopo would need good coordination capacity so that partners that are being mobilized at different levels to assist the displaced and affected populations, would be coordinated amongst, aligned with the Inter-Agency Standing Committee (IASC) MHPSS guidelines and coherent in using the MHPSS resources.</narrative>
  </description>
